# VED TRAVELS — GOOGLE SHEETS & OFFLINE CONFIGURATION
# Follow GOOGLE_SHEETS_SETUP.md for 2-minute step-by-step instructions.

# 1. Google Sheets Web App Webhook URL (Free cloud database)
# Deploy google-apps-script.js via Extensions > Apps Script in Google Sheets and paste your URL here:
GOOGLE_SHEET_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_GOOGLE_APPS_SCRIPT_ID/exec
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SHEETS_API_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_GOOGLE_APPS_SCRIPT_ID/exec

# 2. Ved Travels Vadodara Business UPI & WhatsApp Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_VED_UPI_ID=your_upi_id@upi
NEXT_PUBLIC_VED_UPI_NAME="Ved Travels Vadodara"
NEXT_PUBLIC_VED_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=919546883777
